     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
       <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document specifies two Lightweight Directory Access Protocol
-(LDAP) attributes, vendorName and vendorVersion that MAY be included
+(LDAP) attributes, vendorName and vendorVersion that <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> be included
 in the root DSA-specific Entry (DSE) to advertise vendor-specific
 information.  These two attributes supplement the attributes defined
 in section 3.4 of RFC 2251.</t>
